    "body": "Issue sweep: this issue is partly done and stays open.\n\nPart 1 (`camcraft-cli --ui`) merged on `main` in `9046e1dc8` (PR #3861). The tests `egui_app::tests::ui_link::a_cli_ui_call_shows_in_the_window_and_ctrl_z_removes_it` and `ui_link::a_cli_call_with_no_window_says_so_and_exits_3` (`mcp_live`) pin it.\n\nPart 2 (`camcraft-cli --skill <folder|claude|copilot> install`) is still open on `main`:\n- Add the `--skill <folder|claude|copilot> install` command to `camcraft-cli`.\n- Generate the skill text from one source in the repository.\n- Add a drift test that checks each CLI verb in the skill text.\n- Add a test for each target (`folder`, `claude`, `copilot`) in a temporary folder.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
